{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39542","headline":"华阳道者 · 张蠙","name":"华阳道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华阳洞里持真经，心嫌来客风尘腥。\n惟餐白石过白日，拟骑青竹上青冥。\n翔螭岂作汉武驾，神娥徒降燕昭庭。\n长生不必论贵贱，却是幽人骨主灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}